exports[`notice templates > staff-reveals renders HTML and text without personal data 1`] = `
"Subject: Many reveals in the staff area

Many reveals in an hour

The staff account starting aaaaaaaa revealed 10 email or wallet addresses in the last hour.

If that was not expected, use Sign out everywhere for that account and take it off the staff list. Each reveal and its reason is in the audit log.

Open the audit log: https://www.berthmarkets.com/staff/audit

You get this because you are a staff admin of Berth.
Not you? Write to us at support@berthmarkets.com.

Berth. Wall Street, in your wallet."
`;

