exports[`notice templates > weekly-summary renders HTML and text without personal data 1`] = `
"Subject: Your Berth week of 21 September

Your week

Here is your account for the week of 21 September, as of the close on Friday 25 September.

Your account
Worth at the close: $1,284.60
Your change this week: +1.24%
S&P 500 ETF, same days: +0.81%

What you hold
NVIDIA: $642.10, +3.02%
S&P 500 ETF: $410.25, +0.81%
Treasury ETF: $232.25, +0.08%
Beside each, its price's move over the week.

Orders
Filled: 3 buys, of which 1 was a limit order
Limit orders: 1 expired

Friends
New friends: 1
Salutes: 3

Your change counts what your holdings did, not money you added or took out.
Values are at the market's close, in US dollars.

Open Berth: https://www.berthmarkets.com/

You get this because the weekly summary is on.
Turn these off: https://www.berthmarkets.com/api/email/unsubscribe?t=sample-token

Berth. Wall Street, in your wallet."
`;

